OBSERVE p21-after reserveUnspent total=100000 dust=1/4000
PASS p21-spendable-total the swept total counts only the notes the wallet can spend (100000)
PASS p21-residue-reported the unspendable residue is reported (1 notes / 4000 zats)
PASS p21-ids-spendable-only the sweep's source ids are the spendable notes only (["1111111111111111111111111111111111111111111111111111111111111111:orchard:0"])
PASS p21-boundary the rule is value_zats > 5,000 (ZIP-317 MARGINAL_FEE): 5,000 itself is dust, 5,001 is spendable
PASS p21-d5-gate-clears-for-a-receipted-dust-stray a refunded 4,000-zat stray (paid from other notes) never keeps the return waiting — the dust note is residue, not debt
OBSERVE p21-after seeded batch 1 7e4b73bfeef08adb… change 30000 + dust note 4000
OBSERVE p21-after settle exit=0
  | {"auction_id":"ba24d4e31bd28ec15e7a139863820ed5d8ed59b9540cb870c8ac7c6a11171426","batch":2,"allocated":1}
  | settlement broadcast c6e673f8f2dcca39ecdf2ad7b8b5c41b51577ae5c64f677b2f186d34a2ccbddf
  | {"auction_id":"ba24d4e31bd28ec15e7a139863820ed5d8ed59b9540cb870c8ac7c6a11171426","settled":6}
PASS p21-return-completes the custody return completes: the sweep spends the 30,000 spendable note at the 10,000 fee and returns 20,000 (exit 0, 6 receipts)
PASS p21-residue-published the published accounting carries the residue: {"dust_notes":1,"dust_zats":"4000","fee_zats":"10000","remaining_zats":"30000"}
PASS p21-verify-accepts benzo verify accepts the published dir with the residue (exit 0); 19 OK lines
PASS p21-rerun-idempotent a re-run is clean and republishes byte-equal accounting (exit 0)
RESULT PASS
